# SPA rewrite — Netlify / Cloudflare Pages.
#
# Without this, refreshing /rankings or /school/16 returns a 404 from the host,
# because only index.html and assets/ exist on disk. Every path that is not a
# real file is served the app, which then routes it client-side.
#
# The order matters: real files win, because `try_files`-style fallbacks are
# evaluated left to right. `/assets/*` is listed first so a hashed chunk is
# never swallowed by the catch-all.

/assets/*  /assets/:splat  200
/fonts/*   /fonts/:splat   200
/favicon.svg               200
/robots.txt                200
/sitemap.xml               200
/*         /index.html     200
